# Scout's place search and the pin's name. Nominatim sends no CORS header, so
# the published page reaches it through this site's own origin, and reads the
# answer itself (src/lib/scout/view/scout-api.ts). These rules live here rather
# than in netlify.toml so they ship inside dist/client: a Netlify Drop deploy
# of that folder gets search too. Query strings pass through.
/nominatim/search   https://nominatim.openstreetmap.org/search   200!
/nominatim/reverse  https://nominatim.openstreetmap.org/reverse  200!
